# Prior-art and reference material. Kept on disk as a living reference, excluded
# from the repository: `reference/infinite-canvas-dynamic-grid/` is derived from
# deobfuscated third-party code ("Robot Components" nodegrid), and the rest is
# copied prior art that is clutter in a public tree. The originals remain in
# kek-monorepo (apps/web/reference/infinite-canvas/). See docs/SHIP_PLAN.md.
#
# NOTE: untracking only removes these from HEAD. The derived implementation is
# still reachable in git history, so a public repo leaks it regardless. Purging
# that needs a history rewrite -- irreversible, and the owner's call.
reference/

# Stop-hook completion sentinel (local only)
.claude/.goal-complete
